 a third capture.\n\nNothing started, nothing asked.", "ttft_ms": 4876, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 23954, "uuid": "4bd74233-3bfe-4c74-8f54-d43aa497aaa3", "ttft_stream_ms": 1313, "time_to_request_ms": 255, "first_content_frame_ms": 1570, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}